  "content": "\n\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n<h1>清新 &amp; 流畅</h1>\n<p>这是一个<strong>整合包</strong>，专注于收录能让<strong>游戏更加生动</strong>、体验尽可能清新（且流畅）的模组与材质包。<br><br><span style=\"color:#f00\"><strong>1.21.6</strong></span> 版本偶尔会出现崩溃情况，为追求最高稳定性，请改用 <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><span style=\"color:#008000;text-decoration:underline\">1.21.5</span></strong></span>。<br><br>此版本缺少“附魔轮廓”模组，请手动从 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fenchantment-glint-outline\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Outlines 模组</a><br><br>你也可以在 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fenchantment-glint-outline\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a> 上游玩本整合包。<br><br></p>\n<h2>以下模组未收录于 Modrinth 生态，特此致谢：</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252ftexture-pack%252faction-s-amp-stuff-pumpkin-no-blur%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Action and Stuff 南瓜</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fvisual-effects-plus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Visual Effects+</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2><br>灵感来源是什么？</h2>\n<p>本项目的主要<strong>灵感</strong>来自两个附加组件：<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.minecraft.net%252fen-us%252fmarketplace%252fpdp%253fid%253d61c7a786-d7ad-49e0-a710-817121cd9795\" rel=\"nofollow\">Actions &amp; Stuff</a></strong> 和 <strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.minecraft.net%252fen-us%252fmarketplace%252fpdp%253fid%253d2249c366-c812-4fe5-a6ec-abe9d6bea6bc\" rel=\"nofollow\">Realistic Biomes</a></strong>。</p>\n<p>该整合包支持 <strong>1.21.5</strong> 和 <strong>1.21.6</strong> <strong>Fabric</strong> 版本；鉴于此处收录的模组数量，性能几乎可以保证稳定流畅，无需担心。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/_srPykohHSQ\" width=\"806\" height=\"861\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><br><br>这是一个专注于为游戏增添动态效果、体验尽可能清新（且流畅）的模组与材质包整合包。</p>\n<p>本项目的主要灵感来自两个附加组件，&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.minecraft.net%252fen-us%252fmarketplace%252fpdp%253fid%253d61c7a786-d7ad-49e0-a710-817121cd9795\" rel=\"nofollow\">Actions &amp; Stuff</a>&nbsp;和&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.minecraft.net%252fen-us%252fmarketplace%252fpdp%253fid%253d2249c366-c812-4fe5-a6ec-abe9d6bea6bc\" rel=\"nofollow\">Realistic Biomes</a>。</p>\n<p>该整合包同时支持 1.20.1 和 1.21.1 的 Fabric 版本（Forge 版本也即将推出）；鉴于此处收录的模组数量，性能几乎可以保证稳定流畅，无需担心。</p>\n<p><br><br><span><span><iframe style=\"width:622px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Tq6TZfTmhZA\" width=\"622\" height=\"362\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>",
